\section{ELF64 (AArch64) loader: maps the PT\_LOAD segments of a program from the}
\label{src:elf.c}

Minix disk into a fresh user address space (replaces the [[x86]] ELF32 loader).
Permissions follow the segment flags: R+X -> code, R -> read-only data, R+W -> data/bss.
A segment that is both writable and executable is refused (W\textasciicircum{}X).

@

